resolver.yaml
splitter.yaml
http-route.yaml
intention.yaml

If you deploy this way then probably you don't need to create MeshService configuration entry for static-server-test app and define it in http route. 
In http route you can directly mention the service name only. Splitter and Resolver works fine with this approach if you scale any of the v1 or v2 or both deployments 
This approach creates two deployments with different names but have same service account and service.
